From 5bab54a8b85e6d700c67001163b5a71170e0e887 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Braden <snufflyy@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:08:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(vulkan): enumerate complete surface format lists

Native Wayland on RADV exposes 99 format/colorspace pairs. The fixed 64-entry array caused VK_INCOMPLETE, then a silent headless fallback. Allocate the reported list and retry a changing list at most four times, preserving the existing UNORM preference. Own implementation, title-agnostic.

Add a GPU-independent regression that fails on the old implementation and covers large lists, count changes, allocation failure and driver errors.
---
